868	    /// <summary>
869	    /// Self-healing normalizer for commission percentage values.
870	    /// The DB contract is that rates are stored as decimal fractions (0.20 = 20%).
871	    /// Legacy bad saves wrote whole numbers (20.0 instead of 0.20).
872	    /// Any value greater than 1.0 is assumed to be whole-number percent and is
873	    /// divided by 100; values already in [0, 1] are returned unchanged.
